data modify storage bittersweet:almanac book.pages append value "\
§2§lVolatile Mycelium\n\n\
§0Creepers are cave-dwelling fungi which rarely come to the surface. \
Their unusual pigmentation allows them to blend almost perfectly with deepslate, \
making them exceptionally difficult to spot in the dark. \
They are also considerably—"
data modify storage bittersweet:almanac book.pages append value "\
—more nimble than one might expect. Fortunately, they appear to have an aversion to being watched. \
A creeper that knows it's been discovered will remain unnaturally still, waiting for its victim to look away. \
Creepers rupture violently when in close proximity, releasing—"
data modify storage bittersweet:almanac book.pages append value "\
—a cloud of poisonous spores alongside the blast. \
Shields are not as effective against these creatures, as the spores will cover you from all sides. \
These spores also bond to zombie flesh, patching up their wounds."
data modify storage bittersweet:almanac book.pages append value "\
Ranged options are much more preferable, as you can pick off immobile creepers from afar. \
But if you do not have one, just try to stay away from the blast."
